conjugacyClass(List) -- the conjugacy class of a permutation
************************************************************

  * Function: *note conjugacyClass: conjugacyClass_lpList_rp,
  * Usage: 
        conjugacyClass perm
  * Inputs:
      * perm, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a permutation of the list of
        numbers from 0 to n-1
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note Partition: (Macaulay2Doc)Partition,, a
        partition that represents the conjugacy class of the permutation

Description
===========

The method first calculates the cycle decomposition of the permutation Then the
conjugacy class is the partition given by the lengths of the cycles in the
decomposition



