|                                   |
|o2 = Partition{1, 1, 1, 1, 1}      |
|                                   |
|o2 : Partition                     |
+-----------------------------------+
|i3 : cycleDecomposition {1,3,2,0,4}|
|                                   |
|o3 = {{0, 1, 3}, {2}, {4}}         |
|                                   |
|o3 : List                          |
+-----------------------------------+
|i4 : conjugacyClass     {0,1,2,3,4}|
|                                   |
|o4 = Partition{1, 1, 1, 1, 1}      |
|                                   |
|o4 : Partition                     |
+-----------------------------------+

