firstRowDescent(YoungTableau) -- retrieves the first row descent of a Young tableau
***********************************************************************************

  * Function: *note firstRowDescent: firstRowDescent_lpYoungTableau_rp,
  * Usage: 
        firstRowDescent y
  * Inputs:
      * y, an instance of the type *note YoungTableau: YoungTableau,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the row of the row descent or
        -1 if there is no row descent
      * b, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the column of the row descent
        or -1 if there is no row descent

Description
===========

A row descent is defined to be a cell (a,b) in a tableau $T$ such that
T_(a,b)>T_(a,b+1). This method reads by columns from left to right and each
column is read from the top down until the first row descent is found. If no
row descent is found the pair (a,b)= (-1,-1) is returned.

+---------------------------------------+
|i1 : p = new Partition from {3,2,1}    |
|                                       |
|o1 = Partition{3, 2, 1}                |
|                                       |
|o1 : Partition                         |
+---------------------------------------+
|i2 : y = youngTableau(p,{1,2,3,5,4,6}) |
|                                       |
|o2 = | 1 2 3 |                         |
|     | 5 4 |                           |
|     | 6 |                             |
|                                       |
|o2 : YoungTableau                      |
+---------------------------------------+
|i3 : firstRowDescent y                 |
|                                       |
|o3 = (1, 0)                            |
|                                       |
|o3 : Sequence                          |
+---------------------------------------+
|i4 : y2 = youngTableau(p,{1,2,4,3,5,6})|
|                                       |
|o4 = | 1 2 4 |                         |
|     | 3 5 |                           |
|     | 6 |                             |
|                                       |
|o4 : YoungTableau                      |
+---------------------------------------+
|i5 : firstRowDescent y2                |
|                                       |
|o5 = (-1, -1)                          |
|                                       |
|o5 : Sequence                          |
+---------------------------------------+

