generalizedVandermondeMatrix(List,List,PolynomialRing) -- the method for calculating generalized Vandermonde matrices
*********************************************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note generalizedVandermondeMatrix:
    generalizedVandermondeMatrix_lpList_cmList_cmPolynomialRing_rp,
  * Usage: 
        generalizedVandermondeMatrix(indices,exponents,R)
  * Inputs:
      * indices, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a list of the variables
        that appear in each column of the matrix
