|i2 : M = generalizedVandermondeMatrix({0,2,3},{1,3,5},R)|
|                                                        |
|o2 = | x_0   x_2   x_3   |                              |
|     | x_0^3 x_2^3 x_3^3 |                              |
|     | x_0^5 x_2^5 x_3^5 |                              |
|                                                        |
|             3      3                                   |
|o2 : Matrix R  <-- R                                    |
