|                                                                  |
|      3 2      2 3      3   2     2 2 2      3 2    2   3      2 3|
|o3 = x x x  + x x x  + x x x  + 2x x x  + x x x  + x x x  + x x x |
|      0 2 3    0 2 3    0 2 3     0 2 3    0 2 3    0 2 3    0 2 3|
|                                                                  |
|o3 : R                                                            |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+

