|               {0, 2, 1, 3, 4} => x x x  - x x x  - x x x  + x x x  - x x x  |
|                                   0 1 2    0 1 2    0 1 3    0 1 3    0 2 4 |
|                                   2          2      2        2            2 |
|               {0, 2, 1, 4, 3} => x x x  - x x x  - x x x  + x x x  + x x x  |
|                                   0 1 2    0 1 2    0 2 3    1 2 3    0 2 3 |
|                                   2          2      2        2          2   |
|               {0, 3, 1, 4, 2} => x x x  - x x x  - x x x  + x x x  + x x x  |
|                                   0 1 3    0 1 3    0 2 3    1 2 3    0 2 3 |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : HashTable                                                               |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     2      2        2            2        2        2        2               |
|+ x x x  + x x x  - x x x  + x x x  - x x x  - x x x  + x x x }              |
|   1 2 4    0 3 4    2 3 4    0 1 4    1 2 4    0 3 4    2 3 4               |
|       2    2          2      2        2          2        2                 |
|- x x x  - x x x  + x x x  + x x x  - x x x  - x x x  + x x x                |
|   1 2 3    0 2 4    0 2 4    0 3 4    2 3 4    0 3 4    2 3 4               |
