|+ x x x  + x x x  - x x x  + x x x  - x x x  - x x x  + x x x                |
|   1 2 4    0 3 4    1 3 4    0 2 4    1 2 4    0 3 4    1 3 4               |
|       2    2          2      2        2          2        2                 |
|- x x x  - x x x  + x x x  + x x x  - x x x  - x x x  + x x x                |
|   1 2 3    0 1 4    0 1 4    0 3 4    1 3 4    0 3 4    1 3 4               |
|     2      2          2      2        2          2        2                 |
|- x x x  - x x x  + x x x  + x x x  - x x x  - x x x  + x x x                |
|   1 2 3    0 1 4    0 1 4    0 2 4    1 2 4    0 2 4    1 2 4               |
