|                                                 |
|o2 = | 1 0 2 |                                   |
|     | 3 4 |                                     |
|                                                 |
|o2 : YoungTableau                                |
+-------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : peek y                                      |
|                                                 |
|o3 = YoungTableau{partition => Partition{3, 2}  }|
|                  values => MutableList{...5...} |
+-------------------------------------------------+

