YoungTableau == YoungTableau -- checks whether two tableaux are equivalent
**************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note ==: (Macaulay2Doc)==,
  * Usage: 
        y1 == y2
  * Inputs:
      * y1, an instance of the type *note YoungTableau: YoungTableau,, 
      * y2, an instance of the type *note YoungTableau: YoungTableau,, 
  * Outputs:
      * an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, true if the shape and filling of
        tableaux y1 and y2 are the same

Description
===========

+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : y = youngTableau(new Partition from {3,2},{0,2,1,3,4})    |
|                                                               |
|o1 = | 0 2 1 |                                                 |
|     | 3 4 |                                                   |
|                                                               |
|o1 : YoungTableau                                              |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : y1 = youngTableau(new Partition from {3,2},{0,2,1,3,4})   |
|                                                               |
|o2 = | 0 2 1 |                                                 |
|     | 3 4 |                                                   |
|                                                               |
|o2 : YoungTableau                                              |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : y == y1                                                   |
|                                                               |
|o3 = true                                                      |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : y2 =  youngTableau(new Partition from {2,2,1},{0,2,1,3,4})|
|                                                               |
|o4 = | 0 2 |                                                   |
|     | 1 3 |                                                   |
|     | 4 |                                                     |
|                                                               |
|o4 : YoungTableau                                              |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : y == y2                                                   |
|                                                               |
|o5 = false                                                     |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note YoungTableau == YoungTableau: YoungTableau == YoungTableau, -- checks
    whether two tableaux are equivalent
